Author: A.J. Koning, IAEA                                         1428 1451   15
                                                                  1428 1451   16
Ref.: A.J. Koning and D. Rochman,                                 1428 1451   17
      Modern nuclear data evaluation with the TALYS code system,  1428 1451   18
